T1  - A longitudinal imaging study of the effects of type 2 diabetes and microvascular disease on diabetic bone disease
A1  - Zhou M.
A1  - Wu P.-H.
A1  - Joseph G.B.
A1  - Kolluri P.
A1  - Yu I.
