UR  - https://libkey.io/libraries/528/openurl?genre=article&aulast=&issn=&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Expanding+the+Biomarkers+in+Familial+Amyloid+Neuropathy%3A+Magnetic+Resonance+Imaging+%28MRI%29+and+Motor+Unit+Estimation+by+Electrophysiological+Study&volume=&issue=&spage=&epage=&date=2018&doi=&pmid=&sid=OVID:embase
