UR  - https://libkey.io/libraries/528/openurl?genre=article&aulast=&issn=&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Study+SEARCH+026Assessment+of+the+HIV+CNS+Reservoir%2C+Neurological+and+Neuro-cognitive+Effects%2C+and+Source+of+Rebound+HIV+in+CNS+in+Subjects+Participating+in+Study+SEARCH+019&volume=&issue=&spage=&epage=&date=2015&doi=&pmid=&sid=OVID:embase
