UR  - https://libkey.io/libraries/528/openurl?genre=article&aulast=&issn=&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Potential+Role+of+SI00B+and+Brain+Derived+Neurotrophic+Factor+in+Predicting+Outcome+From+Using+Pulsed+Radiofrequency+in+Treatment+of+Patients+With+Lumbar+Disc+Prolapsed&volume=&issue=&spage=&epage=&date=2022&doi=&pmid=&sid=OVID:embase
