T1  - Skeletal muscle MRI-determined fat fraction and myometric strength in inclusion body myositis and Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease Type 1A
T3  - UK Neuromuscular Translational Research Conference. London United Kingdom.
A1  - Sinclair C.D.J.
