T1  - Modeling Postoperative Nerve Regeneration Using Diffusion MRI: A Preclinical Study of a Novel Mathematical Approach
A1  - Esteve I.M.
A1  - Yan L.
A1  - Karagoz H.
A1  - Torres-Guzman R.
A1  - Chaker S.
A1  - Gutama B.
A1  - Cornely R.M.
