T1  - Magnetic Resonance Imaging of the Peripheral Nerves and Fascicles of the Knee Using Double Echo Steady State Sequence at 7 Tesla
A1  - Chen P.
A1  - Zhen Z.
A1  - Li J.
A1  - Yang T.
