T1  - Evolution of peripheral nerve changes in early multiple sclerosis-a longitudinal MR neurography study
A1  - Foesleitner O.
A1  - Hayes J.C.
A1  - Weiler M.
A1  - Sam G.
A1  - Wildemann B.
