T1  - Increased advanced glycation end products measured by skin autofluorescence are associated with diminished sciatic nerve structural integrity in type 2 diabetes
T3  - 60th EASD Annual Meeting of the European Association for the Study of Diabetes. Madrid Spain.
A1  - Kender Z.
A1  - Mooshage C.
A1  - Seebauer L.
A1  - Tsilingiris D.
A1  - Schimpfle L.
A1  - Sulaj A.
A1  - Szendroedi J.
