T1  - Diminished renal function is linked to a decline in the structural integrity of the sciatic nerve among individuals with type 1 and type 2 diabetes
T3  - 60th EASD Annual Meeting of the European Association for the Study of Diabetes. Madrid Spain.
A1  - Seebauer L.
