N2  - The proceedings contain 61 papers. The topics discussed include: inter- and intrareader reproducibility of a novel instability score of the lateral elbow at CT arthrography: the smile score; betting anterior cruciate ligament injury with MRI morphometry; feasibility of CT-guided percutaneous osteosynthesis under local anesthesia; stenosing tenosynovitis of the extensor carpi ulnaris: a reverse de quervain tenosynovitis; ASAS recommendations for requesting and reporting imaging examinations in patients with suspected axial spondyloarthritis; comparison between dedicated MRI and symphyseal fluoroscopic-guided contrast agent injection in the diagnosis of cleft sign and pelvic ring instability in athletic groin pain; performance comparison of a deep learning algorithm and human readers on detection of anterior cruciate ligament tear; novel tomographic imaging of peripheral nerves with high-resolution ultrasonography compared with high-field MR (tractography); what is backfill? new bone formation in axial spondyloarthritis; and MRI radiomics-based machine learning to predict neoadjuvant chemotherapy response in Ewing's sarcoma: preliminary results.
