T1  - COMPARISON OF A STIR- AND T1-WEIGHTED-BASED RADIOMICS MODEL TO DIFFERENTIATE BETWEEN PLEXIFORM NEUROFIBROMAS AND MALIGNANT PERIPHERAL NERVE SHEATH TUMORS IN NEUROFIBROMATOSIS TYPE 1 (NF1)
