T1  - Decreased Microstructural Integrity of the Central Somatosensory Tracts in Diabetic Peripheral Neuropathy
A1  - Fang F.
A1  - Luo Q.
A1  - Ge R.-B.
A1  - Lai M.-Y.
A1  - Gong Y.-J.
