T1  - A multi-center radiomics-based model to differentiate between neurofibromatosis type 1-associated plexiform neurofibromas and malignant peripheral nerve sheath tumors
T3  - 26th Annual Meeting and Education Day of the Society for Neuro-Oncology, SNO. Boston, MA United States.
A1  - Ly I.
