T1  - Highly efficient head-only magnetic field insert gradient coil for achieving simultaneous high gradient amplitude and slew rate at 3.0T (MAGNUS) for brain microstructure imaging
A1  - Foo T.K.F.
A1  - Tan E.T.
A1  - Vermilyea M.E.
