T1  - Can we use genetics to discriminate between multiple sclerosis and adultonset post-infectious inflammatory syndromes?
T3  - 5th Congress of the European Academy of Neurology, EAN 2019. Oslo Norway.
A1  - Martinelli Boneschi F.
