T1  - Multimodal ultra high feld magnetic resonance neurography as a novel toolbox for characterization of experimental diabetic neuropathy
T3  - 53. Jahrestagung der Deutschen Gesellschaft fur Neuroradiologie e.V.. Frankfurt a.M. Germany.
