T1  - MR neurography and diffusion tensor imaging as a potential biomarker of chemotherapy induced peripheral neuropathy
T3  - 40th Annual Scientific Meeting of the Society of Skeletal Radiology. Santa Barbara, CA United States.
A1  - Gimber L.
A1  - Garland L.
A1  - Krupinski E.
