T1  - Novel MR-neurography detects polyneuropathy in type 1 diabetes related to severity and proximal/distal nerve fibre pathology
T3  - 77th Scientific Sessions of the American Diabetes Association, ADA 2017. San Diego, CA United States.
A1  - Vaeggemose M.
