T1  - An inherited TUBB2B mutation alters microtubule dynamics and causes primary errors of axon guidance
T3  - 24th Biennial Meeting of the International Society for Neurochemistry and the American Society for Neurochemistry. Cancun Mexico.
A1  - Cederquist G.Y.
A1  - Luchniak A.
A1  - Tischfield M.A.
A1  - Peeva M.
