T1  - Peripheral nervous system dysfunction in a rat model and in human motor nerve biopsies of amyotrophic lateral sclerosis
T3  - 24th International Symposium on ALS/MND. Milan Italy.
A1  - Riva N.
A1  - Chaabane L.
A1  - Peviani M.
A1  - Ungaro D.
A1  - Domi T.
A1  - Dina G.
A1  - Spano G.
A1  - Cerri F.
