T1  - Characteristics of hypertrophic form of chronic inflammatory demyelinating polyneuropathy
T3  - 2012 Peripheral Nerve Society/Inflammatory Neuropathy Consortium Meeting, PNS/INC. Rotterdam Netherlands.
A1  - Iijima M.
