T1  - Tractography imaging: A useful method in the peripheral neuropathy diagnosis
T3  - 2011 Meeting of the Peripheral Nerve Society. Potomac, MD United States.
A1  - Nascimento O.J.M.
A1  - De Freitas M.R.G.
