T1  - Effect of median-nerve electrical stimulation on bold activity in acute ischemic stroke patients
T3  - 14th European Congress of Clinical Neurophysiology and the 4th International Conference on Transcranial Magnetic and Direct Current Stimulation. Rome Italy.
A1  - Manganotti P.
A1  - Storti S.
A1  - Formaggio E.
